  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the Tier-II Answer Key for the post of Combined Higher Secondary Level Examination 2025 on the official website of SSC. This recruitment was released for 3131 posts. Candidates Can Also Check All Details on Official , Applications for the SSC CHSL Recruitment 2025 were accepted from June 23, 2025, to July 18, 2025. The Tier-II examination is going to Conducted on 22 April 2026 (Reschedule). Candidates who had appeared in Tier-I Examination can download their SSC CHSL Tier-II Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SSC CHSL 10+2 Tier-II Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>23 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>18 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>19 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #00000