Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC CHSL Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>27 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per SSC CHSL Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>SSC CHSL 10+2 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 3131</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Lower Division Clerk/ Junior Secretariat Assistant</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Postal Assistant/ Sorting Assistant</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Data Entry Operator (DEO)</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>SSC CHSL Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Lower Division Clerk/ Junior Secretariat Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their 10+2 Level (Higher Secondary Level) of Examination from any recognized board will be considered for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Typing (English : 35 WPM, Hindi : 30 WPM)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Postal Assistant/ Sorting Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their 10+2 Level (Higher Secondary Level) of Examination from any recognized board will be considered for this recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.0382%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Data Entry Operator (DEO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.9618%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their 10+2 Level (Higher Secondary Level) of Examination from any recognized board will be considered for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Typing (English : 35 WPM, Hindi : 30 WPM).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download SSC CHSL Tier-II Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open on the <strong>Download Tier-II Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;link from the <strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp; box placed below.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In this page, candidates have to fill up the&nbsp; required fields given as following:</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration ID</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Birth/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha code</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">And Click on <strong>Search </strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After submitting the correct details, applicants will be able to download the Answer Key.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=